
## Quick start
Run `cargo test` to execute the tests for the project.
This repository provides a high-performance Rust simulation engine with a GDExtension bridge, designed for memory-safe, deterministic, and multi-threaded physics/data simulations in Godot.

### Run the Simulation Engine
To run the simulation engine, follow these steps:

1. Clone the repository:
   ```sh
   git clone https://github.com/Nueramarcos/vertex-sim-core.git
   cd vertex-sim-core
   ```

2. Build and run the project:
   ```sh
   cargo build
   cargo run
   ```
